# 🚀 Project Workflow

The complete analytical workflow can be summarized as:

```text
Multiple HCAHPS Source Tables
            ↓
      Power Query / M
            ↓
    Data Cleaning & Validation
            ↓
       Star Schema Model
            ↓
       DAX Analytical Layer
            ↓
     Interactive Dashboard
            ↓
      AI-Assisted Analysis
            ↓
      Business Insights
```

---

# 📌 Project Outcome

The project demonstrates an end-to-end Business Intelligence workflow for transforming multiple related healthcare datasets into an interactive Power BI analytical solution.

The final dashboard provides a structured view of:

- Patient-experience KPIs
- Historical performance
- Patient-experience dimensions
- State-level variation
- Regional patterns
- Survey response rates
- Top-Box performance changes

The solution combines **data preparation, relational modeling, analytical calculations, visualization, and business-oriented interpretation** within a single Power BI project.

